{
  "title": "Gen3ia - Qdrant Vector DB",
  "uid": "gen3ia-qdrant",
  "version": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["gen3ia", "qdrant", "vectors"],
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Collections Qdrant",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "gen3ia_vector_collections_total", "legendFormat": "Collections" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Vecteurs stockes",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "gen3ia_vectors_total", "legendFormat": "Vecteurs" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Requetes de recherche",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "rate(gen3ia_vector_searches_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "req/s" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Dimension des vecteurs",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "gen3ia_vector_dimension", "legendFormat": "Dimensions" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Recherches vectorielles (cumul)",
      "type": "graph",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "rate(gen3ia_vector_searches_total[1h])", "legendFormat": "recherches/h" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Temps de reponse Qdrant (ms)",
      "type": "graph",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "gen3ia_vector_search_duration_ms", "legendFormat": "ms" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" } }
    },
    {
      "title": "Adapter actif",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "options": { "content": "## Adapter Vector Store\n\n**Type**: Qdrant (production)\n**Collection**: genova_vectors\n**Distance**: Cosine\n**Dimensions**: 384\n**URL**: http://qdrant:6333\n\nBasculer en SQLite : `VECTOR_STORE_TYPE=sqlite`", "mode": "markdown" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Points par collection",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "gen3ia_vectors_total", "legendFormat": "Points" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Statut Qdrant (+metriques)",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "gen3ia_vectors_total", "legendFormat": "Vecteurs" },
        { "expr": "gen3ia_vector_collections_total", "legendFormat": "Collections" },
        { "expr": "gen3ia_vector_dimension", "legendFormat": "Dimensions" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
